{"start": 586.48, "end": 588.98, "text": "- You're really cool, Alberta."}, {"start": 588.98, "end": 591.98, "text": "- Man, pizza guys are getting worse and worse looking."}, {"start": 591.98, "end": 594.32, "text": "- Guess all the good ones went into porn."}, {"start": 594.32, "end": 595.48, "text": "- Ceiling fan."}, {"start": 595.48, "end": 596.78, "text": "- I miss all the fun."}, {"start": 596.78, "end": 598.4, "text": "- I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 598.4, "end": 600.78, "text": "- Who cares? - Who cares?"}, {"start": 600.78, "end": 607.78, "text": "Okay, starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 607.78, "end": 610.78, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you were not creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 610.78, "end": 613.78, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 617.78, "end": 619.78, "text": "Six, one, two, three, four, five, six, Britta."}, {"start": 619.78, "end": 620.78, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 620.78, "end": 621.78, "text": "Great."}, {"start": 621.78, "end": 623.78, "text": "You know, it's great, air travel."}, {"start": 623.78, "end": 626.78, "text": "I've flown a lot, a lot of airplane stories."}, {"start": 626.78, "end": 628.78, "text": "I once had sex with Earth a kid."}, {"start": 628.78, "end": 631.78, "text": "- I once had sex with Earth a kid. - Okay, I'm going to tickle my pies."}, {"start": 638.78, "end": 640.78, "text": "- You guys are my best. - I'm not going to get a drink."}, {"start": 641.78, "end": 644.78, "text": "- Ow! - Oh my goodness. Are you okay?"}, {"start": 644.78, "end": 646.78, "text": "- Barely felt it. - Let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 648.78, "end": 651.78, "text": "- Did that mean to me fill the toilet dollars? - We're good. I checked."}, {"start": 651.78, "end": 653.78, "text": "- You're the best. - Want to stay up all night talking to our bunk beds?"}, {"start": 653.78, "end": 657.78, "text": "- Do do. - Here, Troy. Happy housewarming."}, {"start": 657.78, "end": 661.58, "text": "Oh, cool. Thanks, Pierce."}, {"start": 661.58, "end": 664.74, "text": "- You make a good nurse, Annie. - Thank you."}, {"start": 664.74, "end": 667.54, "text": "I actually had to apply a tourniquet the other day."}, {"start": 667.54, "end": 669.54, "text": "Like, I got stabbed outside my building."}, {"start": 669.54, "end": 672.66, "text": "What? Annie, you gotta get the hell out of that apartment."}, {"start": 672.66, "end": 675.26, "text": "You don't have to treat me like a kid anymore, remember?"}, {"start": 675.26, "end": 678.62, "text": "Yeah, but adults still need to be protected."}, {"start": 678.62, "end": 681.9, "text": "I can't help but worry about you, Annie."}, {"start": 681.9, "end": 683.5, "text": "You're important to me."}, {"start": 686.5, "end": 688.1, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 688.14, "end": 690.34, "text": "Stop it! Stop the terror, Troy!"}, {"start": 690.38, "end": 693.14, "text": "Fear the terror, Norwegian Troy!"}, {"start": 693.18, "end": 694.94, "text": "What's going on in here?"}, {"start": 694.98, "end": 697.38, "text": "Here's to terrorizing Troy because he's jealous we moved in together."}, {"start": 697.42, "end": 699.38, "text": "- You're the one who's jealous. - Why would I be jealous?"}, {"start": 699.42, "end": 701.66, "text": "Because you're lonely and crazy!"}, {"start": 707.22, "end": 710.5, "text": "Hey, guys, this is Toby, our pizza delivery guy,"}, {"start": 710.54, "end": 712.3, "text": "and I know this is gonna sound nuts,"}, {"start": 712.34, "end": 715.1, "text": "but we're in love and we're getting married."}, {"start": 716.5, "end": 723.94, "text": "I wonder what happened on all those other timelines."}, {"start": 723.94, "end": 724.94, "text": "Wait."}, {"start": 724.94, "end": 727.74, "text": "There are other timelines?"}, {"start": 727.74, "end": 731.02, "text": "Ah, okay."}, {"start": 731.02, "end": 734.02, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 734.02, "end": 736.06, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you are not creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 736.06, "end": 739.02, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 739.02, "end": 741.9, "text": "One, Troy."}, {"start": 741.9, "end": 742.9, "text": "Dammit."}, {"start": 742.9, "end": 746.26, "text": "I'm gonna go as fast as I can so I don't miss anything."}, {"start": 746.26, "end": 753.72, "text": "You know who I used to call Miss Anything? Earth a kid."}, {"start": 753.72, "end": 754.72, "text": "Where are you?"}, {"start": 754.72, "end": 756.42, "text": "I totally set it up."}, {"start": 756.42, "end": 758.28, "text": "I'm checking on my pies."}, {"start": 758.28, "end": 759.28, "text": "No."}, {"start": 759.28, "end": 760.28, "text": "Bathroom?"}, {"start": 760.28, "end": 761.28, "text": "Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 761.28, "end": 762.28, "text": "Jeff, tell us about your father."}, {"start": 762.28, "end": 763.28, "text": "I'm going to get a drink."}, {"start": 763.28, "end": 764.28, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 764.28, "end": 765.28, "text": "Are you okay?"}, {"start": 765.28, "end": 766.28, "text": "I really felt it."}, {"start": 766.28, "end": 767.28, "text": "Let me look it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 767.28, "end": 768.28, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 768.28, "end": 769.28, "text": "Are you okay?"}, {"start": 769.28, "end": 770.28, "text": "I really felt it."}, {"start": 770.28, "end": 771.28, "text": "Well, let me look it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 771.28, "end": 772.28, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 772.28, "end": 773.28, "text": "Oh, my God."}, {"start": 773.28, "end": 774.28, "text": "Are you okay?"}, {"start": 774.28, "end": 775.28, "text": "I really felt it."}, {"start": 775.28, "end": 777.28, "text": "[glass shatters]"}, {"start": 777.28, "end": 778.28, "text": "[gunshot]"}, {"start": 778.28, "end": 779.28, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 779.28, "end": 781.28, "text": "What the hell?"}, {"start": 781.28, "end": 783.28, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 783.28, "end": 785.28, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 785.28, "end": 787.28, "text": "Call 911!"}, {"start": 787.28, "end": 789.28, "text": "Armin, help me stop the bleeding!"}, {"start": 789.28, "end": 791.28, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 791.28, "end": 793.28, "text": "I'm dying!"}, {"start": 793.28, "end": 795.28, "text": "I am dying!"}, {"start": 795.28, "end": 797.28, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 797.28, "end": 799.28, "text": "[screaming]"}, {"start": 799.28, "end": 801.28, "text": "Water!"}, {"start": 801.28, "end": 803.28, "text": "Water! Water!"}, {"start": 803.28, "end": 825.92, "text": "Ah, okay. Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 825.92, "end": 828.04, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 828.04, "end": 829.22, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 833.28, "end": 836.62, "text": "(dramatic music)"}, {"start": 836.62, "end": 838.72, "text": "- Five, one, two, three, four, five."}, {"start": 838.72, "end": 839.68, "text": "I'll bet, I'm on it."}, {"start": 839.68, "end": 841.12, "text": "- You know who else was on it?"}, {"start": 841.12, "end": 843.12, "text": "And do you know what it is?"}, {"start": 843.12, "end": 844.92, "text": "- Everybody give me money."}, {"start": 844.92, "end": 848.3, "text": "- All right, that's got really softened your personality."}, {"start": 849.2, "end": 850.6, "text": "- I banged here with the kid."}, {"start": 852.16, "end": 853.0, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 853.0, "end": 853.84, "text": "- No!"}, {"start": 855.04, "end": 855.86, "text": "- Bathroom."}, {"start": 855.86, "end": 856.7, "text": "- Down the hall."}, {"start": 860.8, "end": 862.3, "text": "I'm eating a drink."}, {"start": 862.3, "end": 863.14, "text": "Ow!"}, {"start": 863.14, "end": 865.34, "text": "- Oh my god, are you okay? - I really felt it."}, {"start": 865.34, "end": 866.42, "text": "- Well, let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 866.42, "end": 867.34, "text": "- Britta's in the bathroom."}, {"start": 867.34, "end": 868.18, "text": "- Oh."}, {"start": 872.02, "end": 873.42, "text": "- Oh no, what happened?"}, {"start": 873.42, "end": 874.5, "text": "- Minor head wound."}, {"start": 876.66, "end": 877.94, "text": "Oh my god."}, {"start": 877.94, "end": 878.92, "text": "What smells amazing?"}, {"start": 878.92, "end": 880.34, "text": "- Oh, someone wants pie!"}, {"start": 881.9, "end": 882.9, "text": "- You look a good nurse."}, {"start": 882.9, "end": 885.14, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 886.84, "end": 888.22, "text": "- Oh my god."}, {"start": 888.22, "end": 890.58, "text": "They taste just like regular sized pies."}, {"start": 890.58, "end": 891.94, "text": "- Oh, yay!"}, {"start": 891.94, "end": 893.36, "text": "Happy housewarming."}, {"start": 893.36, "end": 895.0, "text": "Oh, cool."}, {"start": 895.0, "end": 897.32, "text": "Thanks, Pierce."}, {"start": 897.32, "end": 898.66, "text": "Hey, while we're alone, I just want"}, {"start": 898.66, "end": 900.32, "text": "to say thanks for letting me live with you."}, {"start": 900.32, "end": 902.08, "text": "Sometimes I feel like making desserts"}, {"start": 902.08, "end": 904.42, "text": "is the only thing I'm good for in the group."}, {"start": 904.42, "end": 907.76, "text": "But now it's time for me to try and make it on my own,"}, {"start": 907.76, "end": 909.64, "text": "just like you did."}, {"start": 909.64, "end": 911.2, "text": "I can't help but worry about you, Annie."}, {"start": 911.2, "end": 912.28, "text": "Yeah, I don't think you should."}, {"start": 912.28, "end": 913.08, "text": "No, what?"}, {"start": 913.08, "end": 914.12, "text": "What are you talking about?"}, {"start": 914.12, "end": 917.08, "text": "You're very important to me."}, {"start": 917.08, "end": 918.54, "text": "I was not supposed to eat your stuff."}, {"start": 918.54, "end": 919.68, "text": "We all made an agreement."}, {"start": 919.68, "end": 920.68, "text": "Crap."}, {"start": 920.68, "end": 922.1, "text": "- I was not supposed to say that out loud."}, {"start": 922.1, "end": 923.64, "text": "Crap, okay, cards on the table."}, {"start": 923.64, "end": 925.1, "text": "I'm really high right now."}, {"start": 925.1, "end": 925.94, "text": "- Oh!"}, {"start": 927.2, "end": 929.78, "text": "- Seriously, I want to give you something else."}, {"start": 929.78, "end": 932.7, "text": "A water pick, a speedboat, two water picks."}, {"start": 932.7, "end": 935.86, "text": "- I can't believe I'm feeding my pies to a drug addict."}, {"start": 935.86, "end": 936.7, "text": "- Drug addict?"}, {"start": 936.7, "end": 937.94, "text": "You're a pie pusher."}, {"start": 937.94, "end": 940.46, "text": "You push pies to get love."}, {"start": 940.46, "end": 941.9, "text": "- Give it, Pierce!"}, {"start": 941.9, "end": 944.4, "text": "It feels fun!"}, {"start": 944.4, "end": 948.38, "text": "- I'm sorry, I just had a weird deja vu."}, {"start": 948.38, "end": 949.74, "text": "- You're bad at gift giving."}, {"start": 949.74, "end": 952.18, "text": "- That thing you said about worrying about me?"}, {"start": 952.18, "end": 953.94, "text": "Something my dad always said."}, {"start": 953.94, "end": 956.06, "text": "- I demand to be house-worn!"}, {"start": 956.06, "end": 958.02, "text": "- Shouldn't have brought it up."}, {"start": 958.02, "end": 960.22, "text": "Just reminded me of my dad."}, {"start": 960.22, "end": 961.06, "text": "Anyway."}, {"start": 961.06, "end": 964.08, "text": "- Uh, little make-out 101, less dad talk,"}, {"start": 964.08, "end": 967.26, "text": "and you could ease up on the bubblegum lip gloss."}, {"start": 967.26, "end": 968.26, "text": "- I really could."}, {"start": 968.26, "end": 969.48, "text": "- No, you!"}, {"start": 973.34, "end": 974.18, "text": "Pizza time!"}, {"start": 974.18, "end": 976.9, "text": "- Give me this, you godless hippies cake!"}, {"start": 976.9, "end": 979.18, "text": "- You're a sick, sad, twisted old man,"}, {"start": 979.18, "end": 981.06, "text": "- I hope you die alone."}, {"start": 981.06, "end": 981.9, "text": "- Yeah."}, {"start": 984.92, "end": 987.0, "text": "- I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 992.04, "end": 993.2, "text": "I gotta say, I hope this is the real one"}, {"start": 993.2, "end": 995.16, "text": "because I just found a nickel in the hallway."}, {"start": 998.4, "end": 1000.62, "text": "(buzzer)"}, {"start": 1000.62, "end": 1003.26, "text": "- Okay, starting on my left with one,"}, {"start": 1003.26, "end": 1004.66, "text": "your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 1004.66, "end": 1005.5, "text": "- Just so you know, Jeff,"}, {"start": 1005.5, "end": 1006.78, "text": "you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 1006.78, "end": 1008.2, "text": "- Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 1009.18, "end": 1014.66, "text": "I don't think you should."}, {"start": 1014.66, "end": 1018.4, "text": "K.S. already dominates enough of our lives."}, {"start": 1018.4, "end": 1021.1, "text": "The universe is an endless, raging sea of randomness."}, {"start": 1021.1, "end": 1022.94, "text": "Our job isn't to fight it, but to weather it together."}, {"start": 1022.94, "end": 1027.46, "text": "On the raft of life, a raft held together by those few, rare, beautiful things that"}, {"start": 1027.46, "end": 1028.74, "text": "we know to be predictable."}, {"start": 1028.74, "end": 1029.74, "text": "Ropes?"}, {"start": 1029.74, "end": 1030.74, "text": "Fines."}, {"start": 1030.74, "end": 1031.74, "text": "Fines?"}, {"start": 1031.74, "end": 1032.74, "text": "Let him finish!"}, {"start": 1032.74, "end": 1033.74, "text": "Us."}, {"start": 1033.74, "end": 1037.06, "text": "It won't matter what happens to us as long as we stay honest and accepting of each other's"}, {"start": 1037.06, "end": 1038.94, "text": "flaws and virtues."}, {"start": 1038.94, "end": 1039.94, "text": "and he will always be driven."}, {"start": 1039.94, "end": 1041.22, "text": "Shirley will always be giving."}, {"start": 1041.22, "end": 1042.34, "text": "Pierce will never apologize."}, {"start": 1042.34, "end": 1043.98, "text": "Britt is sort of a wild card from my perspective."}, {"start": 1043.98, "end": 1047.12, "text": "And Jeff will forever remain a conniving son of a bitch."}, {"start": 1047.12, "end": 1047.96, "text": "- I'm big."}, {"start": 1047.96, "end": 1050.28, "text": "- There are six sides to this die and seven of us."}, {"start": 1050.28, "end": 1052.66, "text": "He divides the system by which he never has to get a pizza."}, {"start": 1052.66, "end": 1055.3, "text": "- Chef Willie, crafty Jackrattle."}, {"start": 1055.3, "end": 1056.14, "text": "- Dag, man."}, {"start": 1056.14, "end": 1057.66, "text": "- Pretty low, dude."}, {"start": 1057.66, "end": 1058.66, "text": "It's called friendship."}, {"start": 1058.66, "end": 1060.52, "text": "Look it up and car to it."}, {"start": 1061.62, "end": 1063.66, "text": "- I think we just found our pizza giver."}, {"start": 1063.66, "end": 1064.5, "text": "- Yeah. - Yes, Jeff."}, {"start": 1064.5, "end": 1065.82, "text": "- We did. - Yes, we did."}, {"start": 1065.82, "end": 1067.98, "text": "- Oh, like it matters who goes."}, {"start": 1067.98, "end": 1070.74, "text": "Oh, that's so funny."}, {"start": 1070.82, "end": 1071.74, "text": "Karma."}, {"start": 1073.36, "end": 1076.08, "text": "That guy sucks harder than the toilet in an airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 1076.16, "end": 1077.58, "text": "Airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 1077.66, "end": 1079.08, "text": "Oh, my pies."}, {"start": 1079.66, "end": 1080.66, "text": "Rocks."}, {"start": 1080.74, "end": 1082.0, "text": "Oh!"}, {"start": 1082.92, "end": 1085.92, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1087.16, "end": 1090.26, "text": "♪ Those days are all over ♪"}, {"start": 1090.34, "end": 1093.46, "text": "♪ You don't have to set your mind into the night ♪"}, {"start": 1093.54, "end": 1094.46, "text": "♪ Sing, girl ♪"}, {"start": 1094.54, "end": 1095.5, "text": "♪ Rocks ♪"}, {"start": 1095.58, "end": 1097.14, "text": "I really love your plays."}, {"start": 1097.22, "end": 1098.22, "text": "- You should move here."}, {"start": 1098.22, "end": 1102.98, "text": "♪ You don't have to wear that dress tonight ♪"}, {"start": 1102.98, "end": 1105.32, "text": "♪ Walk the streets for money ♪"}, {"start": 1105.32, "end": 1109.02, "text": "♪ You don't care if it's wrong or if it's right ♪"}, {"start": 1109.02, "end": 1112.4, "text": "♪ Rosie ♪"}, {"start": 1112.4, "end": 1116.04, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1116.04, "end": 1119.58, "text": "- You gotta see what happens when I leave you alone, huh?"}, {"start": 1119.58, "end": 1124.08, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1124.08, "end": 1127.04, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1127.04, "end": 1127.88, "text": "♪ Rock set ♪"}, {"start": 1127.88, "end": 1129.5, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1129.5, "end": 1130.42, "text": "♪ Don't try ♪"}, {"start": 1130.42, "end": 1131.26, "text": "♪ Rock set ♪"}, {"start": 1131.26, "end": 1133.84, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1133.84, "end": 1134.68, "text": "♪ You gotta see ♪"}, {"start": 1134.68, "end": 1138.18, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1139.42, "end": 1142.76, "text": "- Two piers, may he rest in piers?"}, {"start": 1142.76, "end": 1144.6, "text": "(laughing)"}, {"start": 1144.6, "end": 1146.76, "text": "- Shirley, don't you think you've had enough?"}, {"start": 1146.76, "end": 1147.6, "text": "- Of you."}, {"start": 1148.76, "end": 1150.6, "text": "- Guys, I've been thinking about that night over and over."}, {"start": 1150.6, "end": 1151.96, "text": "One thing has become clear."}, {"start": 1151.96, "end": 1153.76, "text": "This is the darkest, most terrible timeline."}, {"start": 1153.76, "end": 1156.72, "text": "Enough with the timeline crap, Abed."}, {"start": 1156.72, "end": 1159.12, "text": "Pierce got shot in the leg and died."}, {"start": 1159.12, "end": 1161.88, "text": "Shirley's a drunk and he's locked in a mental ward"}, {"start": 1161.88, "end": 1164.04, "text": "because her guilt drove her insane."}, {"start": 1164.04, "end": 1166.2, "text": "Jeff lost an arm in the fire."}, {"start": 1166.2, "end": 1169.76, "text": "Troy lost his larynx because for some dumb reason"}, {"start": 1169.76, "end": 1172.96, "text": "he tried to destroy a flaming troll doll by eating it."}, {"start": 1172.96, "end": 1174.56, "text": "- Clearly you don't understand anything"}, {"start": 1174.56, "end": 1175.8, "text": "about the being a troll."}, {"start": 1175.8, "end": 1178.98, "text": "- Life has gone to hell, Abed."}, {"start": 1178.98, "end": 1180.28, "text": "This is real."}, {"start": 1180.28, "end": 1181.12, "text": "Look at us."}, {"start": 1181.12, "end": 1181.96, "text": "Look at me."}, {"start": 1181.96, "end": 1185.06, "text": "Britta, you put one wash-away blue streak in your hair,"}, {"start": 1185.06, "end": 1187.02, "text": "and I lost an arm."}, {"start": 1187.02, "end": 1189.18, "text": "- Exactly, life got dark."}, {"start": 1189.18, "end": 1190.38, "text": "- And all because Jeff rolled a one."}, {"start": 1190.38, "end": 1192.54, "text": "- Oh, I love how this is my fault somehow."}, {"start": 1192.54, "end": 1193.5, "text": "- It's mine."}, {"start": 1193.5, "end": 1195.02, "text": "I've run through that night over and over in my head,"}, {"start": 1195.02, "end": 1196.5, "text": "and I keep coming back to one thought."}, {"start": 1196.5, "end": 1199.08, "text": "I should have caught the die and not let you roll it."}, {"start": 1199.08, "end": 1201.22, "text": "I failed to do that and we all suffered for it,"}, {"start": 1201.22, "end": 1202.62, "text": "but I'm gonna make it up to you."}, {"start": 1205.02, "end": 1205.86, "text": "- What is this?"}, {"start": 1205.86, "end": 1207.66, "text": "- Of all the timelines, this is clearly the darkest,"}, {"start": 1207.66, "end": 1209.7, "text": "which is why I propose we commit to being evil."}, {"start": 1209.7, "end": 1211.14, "text": "I made us all black O.T.s out of felt."}, {"start": 1211.14, "end": 1214.98, "text": "I suggest you put them on until you're able to grow your own."}, {"start": 1214.98, "end": 1217.34, "text": "From now on, I'm Evil Abed."}, {"start": 1217.34, "end": 1220.44, "text": "We are the evil study group, and we have but one evil goal."}, {"start": 1220.44, "end": 1222.22, "text": "Return somehow to the prime timeline,"}, {"start": 1222.22, "end": 1223.92, "text": "the one that I stopped you from rolling that die."}, {"start": 1223.92, "end": 1225.38, "text": "Then we destroy the good versions of ourselves"}, {"start": 1225.38, "end": 1228.5, "text": "and reclaim our proper lives."}, {"start": 1228.5, "end": 1231.48, "text": "Evil Abed, as Evil Jeff, am I allowed"}, {"start": 1231.48, "end": 1232.94, "text": "to pull fewer punches with you?"}, {"start": 1232.94, "end": 1233.84, "text": "Certainly."}, {"start": 1233.84, "end": 1234.9, "text": "I hate you!"}, {"start": 1234.9, "end": 1236.66, "text": "Shut up with your sci-fi crap!"}, {"start": 1236.66, "end": 1241.06, "text": "I lost my damn arm, and you're making fake beards!"}, {"start": 1241.06, "end": 1241.9, "text": "- Go tease."}, {"start": 1253.36, "end": 1254.68, "text": "- Evil Troy and evil Abed."}, {"start": 1263.48, "end": 1264.32, "text": "- What's wrong?"}, {"start": 1265.78, "end": 1266.62, "text": "- I don't know."}, {"start": 1271.06, "end": 1272.76, "text": "I guess nothing."}]}